# Google Places API (New) — powers the auto-updating reviews section.
# Copy to `.env` for local testing (`.env` is gitignored). In production these
# are set as Netlify build environment variables, NOT committed here.
#
# Without these, reviews are unavailable: no numeric rating/count or quote
# cards are shown. A link to Google remains; local development still builds.
# Production values need Netlify's Builds scope and production context.
#
# Do NOT prefix with PUBLIC_ — that would ship the key to the browser bundle.
# See docs/google-reviews-auto-update.md for how to obtain each value.

GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_PLACE_ID=

# Optional. Language for the fetched review text. Defaults to "en".
# GOOGLE_PLACES_LANGUAGE=en

# The scheduled refresh also needs a GitHub Actions repository secret named
# NETLIFY_BUILD_HOOK for the verified skydive.lu Netlify project/main branch.
# Configure it in GitHub, not in this file. Its complete URL is a credential.
